<title>UK: Lb Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln rand three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Lb Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln rand three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LB RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75     MATURITY    01.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/GB/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
